ed in supporting results; recording continuity and unavailable originals retain their stated limitations.",
    "wii-maple-treeway-r": "Mii Tour (2023) recording comparison Archived tour WR: 1:49.29 · newyork NewYork’s 1:49.29 from September2022 carries through this tour. All recovered dated results are slower; DIT’s final 1:49.30 is 0.01 behind. No available completed Maple Treeway R recording with a qualified total was established in these bounded sources. The preserved Wins clip is a lap example. A discussion image labelled world record shows an automated reading of a slower tour leaderboard, so it does not replace the carried WR. No recording has an explicit full-race continuity certification in this archive. Technique reference · Wins · Original source · Preserved video Technique footage is preserved separately and does not establish a completed record. Submission, report and video times Video shared: 2023-05-19 23:26:15 UTC Tour review in progress. Unverified video references remain preserved in supporting results; recording continuity and unavailable originals retain their stated limitations."
